          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa udi wamba ne, Badi badidila ne badi badilengesha bua kubuelabo mu bibidi bua kutendelela, balonda muntu wa munkatshi muabo, badia munyinyi wa ngulube, wa tshintu tshibi ne wa kahuku, nebalue ku nshikidilu wabo hohamue.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua ndi mumanye midimu yabo ne meji abo, ndualua bua kusangisha bisamba bionso bia bantu ne nuaku yonso; nebalue, nebamone butumbi buanyi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nenteke tshimanyinu munkatshi muabo. Nentumine bamue badi bahanduka munkatshi muabo kudi bisamba bia bantu, ku Tâshishi, ku Pula, ku Luda, bobo badi banana buta, ku Tubala ne ku Yawana, ku maloba a kule adi ku muelelu wa mai manene, hadi kabayi banze kunvua lumu luanyi lunene, kabayi banze kumona butumbi buanyi. Nebabambile bua butumbi buanyi munkatshi mua bisamba bia bantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebalue ne bana benu bakuhatulabo mu bisamba bionso bia bantu bua kubafila bu mulambu kudi Yehowa, babendesha ha nyima ha tubalu, mu makalu, mu bihoyi, ha nyima ha nyama ya mpunda,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "66.20:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Dî dia mu français didi",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "mulet",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ne ha nyima ha tumelo. Yehowa udi wamba ne, Nebalue nʼabo ku mukuna wanyi wa tshijila, Yelushalema mene, bu mudi Bena Isalele balua ne mulambu wabo wa bia kudia mu dilonga ditoke ku nsubu wa Yehowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa udi wamba ne, Neadiangatshile bamue babo bua kuikalabo bakuidi ne bua kuikalabo Bena Lewi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
